    to open the Level Up menu.'
  shortText: 'Level {level}: {points} points to spend.

    Bump your fists together
    twice to open the Level Up menu.'
  bonusText: 'Level {level}! Bonus Stats unlocked.


    Open the Level Up menu (bump
    your fists twice) and press the arrow on its right.'
  punchTitle: NEW PUNCH!
  punchesTitle: NEW PUNCHES!
  jabText: 'JAB


    Punch straight, fast.'
  swingText: 'SWING


    Sweep your fist sideways, fast.'
  uppercutText: 'UPPERCUT


    Drive your fist up, fast.'
  swingUppercutText: 'SWING + UPPERCUT


    Sweep sideways or drive up, fast.'
  tripleText: 'TRIPLE PUNCH


    Every flying punch throws 3.'
